Summarize the following passage in three sentences. The Snapdragon 8 Elite mobile platform integrates a custom Oryon CPU, an Adreno GPU, and a Hexagon NPU with HVX vector units and an HMX matrix accelerator. On-device language models benefit from the NPU's tightly coupled VTCM memory and DMA engines, which allow weight tiles to be streamed while computation proceeds. However, unsupported operators fall back to the CPU, and the cost of synchronizing buffers between the host and the NPU can dominate small batch workloads. Careful selection of quantization format, KV cache layout, batch size, and operator fusion determines whether the accelerator delivers real speedups over a well tuned CPU implementation in practice.0.02.446.875 D prompt: "Summarize the following passage in three sentences. The Snapdragon 8 Elite mobile platform integrates a custom Oryon CPU, an Adreno GPU, and a Hexagon NPU with HVX vector units and an HMX matrix accelerator. On-device language models benefit from the NPU's tightly coupled VTCM memory and DMA engines, which allow weight tiles to be streamed while computation proceeds. However, unsupported operators fall back to the CPU, and the cost of synchronizing buffers between the host and the NPU can dominate small batch workloads. Careful selection of quantization format, KV cache layout, batch size, and operator fusion determines whether the accelerator delivers real speedups over a well tuned CPU implementation in practice."
